@startuml
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
scale max 800 width
skinparam padding 2
skinparam ParticipantPadding 20
skinparam maxMessageSize 150

title 3.2 — Creative Direction and Visual Recommendation Generation: Generation & Approval

actor Operator as O
participant "ContentStudio\nView" as UI
participant "CreativeDirection\nController" as CDC
participant "CreativeDirection\nService" as CDS
participant "ContentApproval\nService" as CAS
participant "AIInferenceGateway\nService" as GW
participant "FastAPI\n(Groq Client)" as FP
participant "tbl_creative_\ndirection_output" as DB

== 1. Dependency Gate Check (FR3.11) ==

O -> UI: Click "Generate Creative Direction"
UI -> CDC: POST /api/creative-direction/generate/{profileId}\n?market={market}
CDC -> CDS: generate(profileId, market)
CDS -> CAS: hasApprovedContent(profileId, market)
CAS -> CAS: query tbl_localized_promotional_content\nWHERE approval_status = true

alt no approved 3.1 content (A3)
  CAS --> CDS: false
  CDS --> CDC: throw IllegalStateException("missing_dependency")
  CDC --> UI: HTTP 400 {error: "missing_dependency"}
  UI -> UI: Show error — approve 3.1 captions first
else approved content found
  CAS --> CDS: true
end

== 2. Context Retrieval ==

CDS -> CAS: getApprovedCaptions(profileId, market)
CAS --> CDS: List<String> approvedCaptions
CDS -> CDS: Load BusinessProfile\n(name, categories, UVP, uniquenessScore)
CDS -> CDS: buildForecastContext()\n(ForecastResult + MarketScore — Module 2)

== 3. Creative Direction Generation ==

CDS -> GW: generateCreative(payload)
GW -> FP: POST /internal/creative/generate\n{market, approvedCaptions, categories,\nuniquenessScore, forecastContext}

note right of FP
  gemini_client.generate_creative_direction()
  Groq generates per market:
    visualGuide[] — composition tips
    shots[] — {label, description, lighting}
    moodboard — {palette, references[]}
    platformRecommendations — platform → string

  Platform priority (FR3.16):
    Korea: Naver Blog -> Instagram -> TikTok
    Japan: Facebook -> Instagram -> TikTok
    USA:   Instagram Reels -> TikTok

  On Groq timeout/error:
    curated per-market template, source = "fallback"
end note

alt Groq available
  FP --> GW: CreativeDirectionResponse\n{visualGuide, shots, moodboard,\nplatformRecommendations, source: "groq"}
else Groq unavailable
  FP --> GW: {...fallback template, source: "fallback"}
end

GW --> CDS: raw map

== 4. Persist & Return ==

CDS -> DB: INSERT tbl_creative_direction_output\n(shot_list_recommendations, visual_recommendations,\nlighting_suggestions, moodboard_references,\nplatform_recommendations, visual_tone)\napproval_status = false
DB --> CDS: saved entity
CDS --> CDC: CreativeDirectionDto
CDC --> UI: CreativeDirectionDto\n{visualGuide, shots, moodboard, platformRecommendations}
UI -> UI: Render VisualDirectionBoard

== 5. Approve Creative Direction ==

O -> UI: Review output and confirm
UI -> CDC: POST /api/creative-direction/approve/{profileId}\n?market={market}
CDC -> CDC: approveLatest(profileId, market)
CDC -> DB: UPDATE approval_status = true\nSET approved_at = now()
DB --> CDC: updated entity
CDC --> UI: {approvedId, market}

@enduml
